ine/godot/pull/107395.patch","merged_at":"2025-10-14T00:35:29Z"},"body":"See: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106164#discussion_r2130182956, https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104676#discussion_r2139520526\r\n\r\nThis PR fixes a bug in the TabContainer theming, where `make_flat_stylebox(p_config.dark_color_1, 0, 0, 0, 0, p_config.corner_radius * EDSCALE)` was called to create the stylebox for the TabBar background, but `make_flat_stylebox` multiplies all the input values by `EDSCALE`, so `EDSCALE` was incorrectly applied twice. With the change applied, the `tabbar_background` stylebox completely covers the bottom panel, meaning that there is no need for the negative extended margin that the Debugger's hack used previously, just the zero margins.\r\n\r\nThis allows for the hacks used to create the Debugger panel's margins (the `BottomPanelDebuggerOverride` stylebox) to be removed completely.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107395/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"